+#   2. no membership      - at an EXACT tie, a price any reader can pay outranks one behind a paid
+#                           membership. It also stops the report line "cheapest: Sam's Club $X  |
+#                           no-membership: Aldi $X", which reads as if the membership bought something.
+#                           0 of the 572 rows on the 2026-09-17 board exercise this key today - no tie there
+#                           pairs a membership store with a non-membership one - so it is stated and
